er"},{"text":"Technology sector lagging the market significantly, underperforming by 9% over 3 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Technology ETF trading well below its long-term trend","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Elevated sector volatility (52% annualized) adds uncertainty","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Sector under pressure with a 18.0% decline over the past 6 months","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Cybersecurity liability and talent cost inflation \u2014 a single breach can erase years of goodwill, and the war for engineering talent compresses margins even at scale.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Valued at a 192% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Altman Z comfortably in the safe zone \u2014 a fortress balance sheet on this measure","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Gross margin tops the Technology peer set \u2014 genuine pricing power is present here","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Figma CEO Dylan Field Donates 80,000 Shares of Class A Stock on November 23, 2026","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/figma-ceo-dylan-field-donates-80000-shares-of-class-a-stock-on-november-23-2026","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795642255.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["leadership"]},{"title":"Figma CRO Shaunt Voskanian Sells 21,453 Shares at $17.18 Average Price Under Modified 10b5-1 Plan","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/figma-cro-shaunt-voskanian-sells-21453-shares-at-1718-average-price-under-modified-10b5-1-plan","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795642253.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Figma Officer Shaunt Voskanian An